Hi Subrata,

I prepared a new release of the LCOV package. Attached are the
corresponding files. Could you please add them to the "Coverage Analysis"
section of the ltp files page? Thank you!

Here's a quick summary of the main new features:

LCOV 1.8 includes:
- support for branch coverage
- support for exclusion markers: users can exclude lines of
  code from coverage reports by addings keywords to the source code
- "package" support: gcov analysis can be done on the build machine
  instead of the test machine
- support for the gcov-kernel infrastructure found in Linux 2.6.31
- --demangle-cpp option to convert C++ function names to human
  readable format
- several bug fixes
- several improvements to the HTML display

Regards,
  Peter,

